# Rates UI

Guests see weekday **300 €** (Pon–Čet) and weekend **500 €** (Pet–Ned). Never show 15%/25% stay discounts.

## Approved compact fare (remember / revert to this)

One short two-cell strip — not two stacked cards. ~2 lines tall. No confirmation paragraph inside the booking sheet.

- Left: `Radni dani` + `Pon – Čet` / **300** € / noć
- Right: `Vikend` + `Pet – Ned` / **500** € / noć (copper number, faint warm fill)
- Classes: `.vh-fare`, `.vh-fare-cell`, `.vh-fare-cell--peak`, `.vh-fare-label`, `.vh-fare-sum`
- Keep side-by-side on phone. Do not stack.

## Do not ship

- Two tall rate cards (phone scroll)
- Forest/sunset split, sun/moon icons, script “ili” medallion, giant display numbers
- Extra muted disclaimer under the rates in `variant="bubble"`
